/// factReceiptLine: A transactional fact table storing sales data at the receipt line level. Each row represents one item sold on a receipt, containing measures (DiscountAmount, DiscountPercentage, ProfitAmount, Quantity, SalesAmount) and foreign keys to dimensions (product, date, customer). Grain: one row per receipt line item.
